sequenceDiagram
    %% W1D1 — DSPy ChainOfThought Request + Compilation Flow
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant App as Application
    participant DSPy as DSPy Runtime
    participant LM as LM Backend

    Note over Dev,LM: Inference Path
    Dev->>App: python src/main.py
    App->>DSPy: cot(question="...")
    DSPy->>DSPy: Load compiled demos from program state
    DSPy->>DSPy: Format prompt (signature + demos)
    DSPy->>LM: POST /chat/completions
    LM-->>DSPy: Raw completion text
    DSPy->>DSPy: Parse rationale and answer fields
    alt Parsing succeeds
        DSPy-->>App: Prediction(rationale, answer)
    else Parsing fails
        DSPy->>LM: Retry with format correction hint
        LM-->>DSPy: Corrected completion
        DSPy-->>App: Prediction(rationale, answer)
    end
    App-->>Dev: Print typed results

    Note over Dev,LM: Compilation Path (one-time, offline)
    Dev->>DSPy: teleprompter.compile(cot, trainset)
    loop For each training example
        DSPy->>LM: Forward pass
        LM-->>DSPy: Prediction
        DSPy->>DSPy: Score with metric function
    end
    DSPy->>DSPy: Collect passing demos
    DSPy-->>Dev: Compiled program with optimal few-shots embedded
